HoennSeek_Text_ChainPool_BROCK_0::
	.string "My brothers and sisters each have\na favorite fossil in this MUSEUM.\lThere are ten of them. That's a\llot of favorites.$"

HoennSeek_Text_ChainPool_BROCK_1::
	.string "A good BREEDER watches before\nacting. So does a good friend. So\ldoes a good GYM LEADER, come to\lthink of it.$"

HoennSeek_Text_ChainPool_BROCK_2::
	.string "Keep your POKéMON's bedding dry\nand their food warm.\pROCK types too. Especially\nROCK types.$"

HoennSeek_Text_ChainPool_BROCK_3::
	.string "ROCK POKéMON can go a week without\neating, you know. I still cook for\lmine every day. It's\lthe principle.$"

HoennSeek_Text_ChainPool_BROCK_4::
	.string "Your ONIX looks great! See how its\nrocks shine? Somebody's been\lpolishing it. I can always tell.$"

HoennSeek_Text_ChainPool_BROCK_5::
	.string "A GEODUDE following you! Rub it\nwith a damp cloth now and then. It\lwon't say so, but it likes that.$"

HoennSeek_Text_ChainPool_BROCK_6::
	.string "You have a STEELIX! It started out\nas an ONIX, like my first partner.\lI wonder what it remembers.$"

HoennSeek_Text_ChainPool_BROCK_7::
	.string "You found a LILEEP in HOENN? Those\nfossils come from the sea floor. A\lplant that crawled out of\lthe ocean!$"

HoennSeek_Text_ChainPool_BROCK_8::
	.string "ANORITH! Its claws are built for\nthe sea, but it walks on land like\lit was born there. Tough\llittle thing.$"

HoennSeek_Text_ChainPool_BROCK_9::
	.string "Your AERODACTYL flew when the\nskies were empty. Mine still\lscreeches at PIDGEY out of\lold habit.$"

HoennSeek_Text_ChainPool_BROCK_10::
	.string "OMANYTE's shell spirals the same\nway every single time. Nature is\lvery tidy, if you look closely.$"

HoennSeek_Text_ChainPool_BROCK_11::
	.string "A RELICANTH! A living fossil. It\nhasn't changed in a hundred\lmillion years, and it doesn't\lneed to.$"

HoennSeek_Text_ChainPool_BROCK_12::
	.string "ROXANNE in RUSTBORO writes to this\nMUSEUM about fossils. Her letters\lhave footnotes. I respect that.$"

HoennSeek_Text_ChainPool_BROCK_13::
	.string "You beat WALLACE? All that grace\non the outside, and solid as\lgranite underneath. I'd like to\ltry him myself.$"

HoennSeek_Text_ChainPool_BROCK_14::
	.string "You beat RED? He came through\nPEWTER once. He didn't say a word,\ljust nodded at the fossils.$"

HoennSeek_Text_ChainPool_BROCK_15::
	.string "Sixteen BADGES! When I started\nout, I thought eight was the\lwhole world.$"

HoennSeek_Text_ChainPool_BROCK_16::
	.string "There's a trainer in HOENN named\nBROCK? An ATHLETE? Tell him the\lname comes with responsibilities.$"

HoennSeek_Text_ChainPool_BROCK_17::
	.string "That other BROCK calls you his\nbest friend? I'm not jealous.\lROCKS don't get jealous.$"

HoennSeek_Text_ChainPool_BROCK_18::
	.string "Eight BADGES in HOENN, too? Your\nPOKéMON must eat well. That's half\lthe work, you know.$"

HoennSeek_Text_ChainPool_MISTY_0::
	.string "The show's over, but I still swim\nthe SEAFOAM current every weekend.\lIt's my thinking time.$"

HoennSeek_Text_ChainPool_MISTY_1::
	.string "My sisters think the show was all\nabout them. I let them think it.\lThat's what sisters are for.$"

HoennSeek_Text_ChainPool_MISTY_2::
	.string "PSYDUCK fell in the pool during\nthe bows. The crowd thought it was\lplanned. It was NOT planned.$"

HoennSeek_Text_ChainPool_MISTY_3::
	.string "Water POKéMON aren't just pretty,\nyou know.\pThey're tough. Like me!$"

HoennSeek_Text_ChainPool_MISTY_4::
	.string "Your STARMIE's core is so bright!\nSomebody's been swimming it in\lclean water. Good.$"

HoennSeek_Text_ChainPool_MISTY_5::
	.string "A PSYDUCK! Does yours get\nheadaches too? Mine gets one every\ltime I raise my voice. So, often.$"

HoennSeek_Text_ChainPool_MISTY_6::
	.string "Your GOLDUCK swims like an arrow.\nMine still floats on its back when\lit thinks nobody's looking.$"

HoennSeek_Text_ChainPool_MISTY_7::
	.string "Your LAPRAS is humming! They sing\nwhen they're happy. Don't tell\lanyone, but I sang along once.$"

HoennSeek_Text_ChainPool_MISTY_8::
	.string "You have a GYARADOS! I used to be\nscared of them. Now I just think\lthey're misunderstood.$"

HoennSeek_Text_ChainPool_MISTY_9::
	.string "You raised a MILOTIC? I'd love to\nsee it swim. They say it calms any\lstorm it passes.$"

HoennSeek_Text_ChainPool_MISTY_10::
	.string "KINGDRA! CLAIR has one too. Don't\ntell her I said hers looks grumpy.$"

HoennSeek_Text_ChainPool_MISTY_11::
	.string "You caught the POKéMON that made\nthe oceans? I'm a little jealous.\lOkay, a lot jealous.$"

HoennSeek_Text_ChainPool_MISTY_12::
	.string "ARTICUNO roosts deep in SEAFOAM.\nI've heard it sing over the water,\lbut I've never seen it up close.$"

HoennSeek_Text_ChainPool_MISTY_13::
	.string "You beat JUAN in SOOTOPOLIS? I\nhear his gym floor is made of ice.\lMine's a pool. Mine's better.$"

HoennSeek_Text_ChainPool_MISTY_14::
	.string "WALLACE won a contest with a water\nshow once. I watched the tape a\lhundred times. For research!$"

HoennSeek_Text_ChainPool_MISTY_15::
	.string "BROCK told me about your trip to\nMT. MOON. He wouldn't stop talking\labout CLEFAIRY eggs. For an hour.$"

HoennSeek_Text_ChainPool_MISTY_16::
	.string "You beat RED? He swam to the\nSEAFOAM ISLANDS once. In jeans. I\lstill don't know how.$"

HoennSeek_Text_ChainPool_MISTY_17::
	.string "Sixteen BADGES? You've seen more\ngyms than I have pools.\lWell, almost.$"

HoennSeek_Text_ChainPool_BLUE_0::
	.string "Gramps calls every Sunday now.\nEvery Sunday! This is your fault,\lyou know.$"

HoennSeek_Text_ChainPool_BLUE_1::
	.string "DAISY made a PIDGEOT DOLL for my\nGYM. I put it in the back. Way in\lthe back.$"

HoennSeek_Text_ChainPool_BLUE_2::
	.string "This road goes to the LEAGUE. I\nwas CHAMPION for about five\lminutes once. Best five\lminutes ever.$"

HoennSeek_Text_ChainPool_BLUE_3::
	.string "Smell ya later!\p...What? It's a classic. You'll\nmiss it when I'm gone.$"

HoennSeek_Text_ChainPool_BLUE_4::
	.string "A PIDGEOT, huh? Mine was my first\ncatch, back when it was a PIDGEY.\lYours looks almost as fast.$"

HoennSeek_Text_ChainPool_BLUE_5::
	.string "Your RHYPERIOR looks tough. Mine's\ntougher. Want to settle it at my\lGYM sometime?$"

HoennSeek_Text_ChainPool_BLUE_6::
	.string "An ARCANINE! Mine still chases its\ntail when it thinks I'm not\llooking. Don't tell anyone.$"

HoennSeek_Text_ChainPool_BLUE_7::
	.string "An EEVEE! Gramps gave me one once.\nI couldn't pick what to evolve it\linto for weeks.$"

HoennSeek_Text_ChainPool_BLUE_8::
	.string "You've got a TYRANITAR too? Good.\nNow we're even. Almost.$"

HoennSeek_Text_ChainPool_BLUE_9::
	.string "You caught MEW?! Gramps would cry.\nSeriously, don't tell him, he'll\lmake it a whole thing.$"

HoennSeek_Text_ChainPool_BLUE_10::
	.string "MEWTWO... I heard it was in the\ncave by CERULEAN. You went in\lthere? Okay, I'm impressed.$"

HoennSeek_Text_ChainPool_BLUE_11::
	.string "You beat NORMAN in PETALBURG? A\nGYM LEADER whose kids are trainers\ltoo. Sounds exhausting.$"

HoennSeek_Text_ChainPool_BLUE_12::
	.string "HOENN's CHAMPION is a contest\nstar? Huh. I bet he never had to\lbeat his own rival in his\lgrandpa's lab.$"

HoennSeek_Text_ChainPool_BLUE_13::
	.string "BRENDAN and MAY say you beat them\nboth at once. They talk about you\la lot. It's annoying.$"

HoennSeek_Text_ChainPool_BLUE_14::
	.string "You helped BROCK and MISTY too?\nYou're making the rest of us KANTO\lLEADERS look lazy.$"

HoennSeek_Text_ChainPool_BLUE_15::
	.string "You beat RED. I've never beaten\nhim. Not once. ...Okay,\lnot lately.$"

HoennSeek_Text_ChainPool_BLUE_16::
	.string "Sixteen BADGES. Mine's one of\nthem. Don't forget that.$"
